{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Disposition evidence (current origin/main 92bfc4d3919072daa85fbd5664489d3b95693bd0): all acceptance criteria are satisfied by already-merged work, so no code change was made here.\n\nAC1/AC2/AC4: commit 34fb74d44b11229a7907eb682085b1b1373233d6 (`Guard unit-tier subprocess isolation at collection`, rebar-ticket 15f2-f3d4-ffcd-4223) identifies the culprit class as unit-tier subprocess sites that build env= mappings from scratch and lose inherited REBAR_ROOT; the commit message records the empirical census (869 spawn sites, 10 fixed, 24 intentional opt-outs). Path/line evidence on current main: tests/conftest.py:575-605 sets a session-scoped sandbox REBAR_ROOT; tests/_subprocess_isolation.py:1-57 documents and implements the collection-time predicate; tests/unit/test_collection_isolation_guard.py pins the oracle, including `test_the_live_unit_tier_collects_clean`.\n\nAC3/AC4 empirical verification in linked worktree copilot-xoni-aruanas-20260907: after removing the worktree-root `.tickets-tracker`, `env -u GIT_CONFIG_* PATH=$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH make verify` completed `19996 passed, 80 skipped, 20 warnings in 3419.51s (0:56:59)` and printed `ROOT_TRACKER_ABSENT_AFTER_VERIFY`. Targeted oracle also passed: `python -m pytest -q tests/unit/test_collection_isolation_guard.py tests/unit/test_repo_isolation_guard.py` -> `48 passed in 54.17s`. The first full verify attempt reproduced only the known Copilot GIT_CONFIG artifact in `tests/interfaces/test_rebar_repo_isolation.py::test_copy_repoints_sibling_origin_and_keeps_refs_isolated`; rerunning that test with GIT_CONFIG_* unset passed (`1 passed in 8.58s`).\n\nConclusion: fixed on main before this session; closing as preexisting."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788811961680440001,"uuid":"6bb4a709-7d7d-408f-893c-2549ef6af9d7"}